qtci-run --config project-two.config 
{code}

description:
{code:java}
File: create_config.py

180:    if local_project_exists (local_project):        
181:        config_name = "project_{0}".format(os.path.basename(local_project)) 

{code}
 

We are storing the settings related to Qt CI plugin in the *UserHome/QtCloud/settings.config* file. For every project, the settings section is named as *project_*<basename of path>. This functionality should move into helpers section instead of create_config.py so that this is common across all scripts.

