description:
We should be improve our dockerfiles with relevant entrypoint or wrapper scripts or similar so that the customer can directly use "docker run" to compile or build the Qt application. 

 

One such example is the *emsdk.*
{code:java}
docker run --rm -v $(pwd):/src -u $(id -u):$(id -g) emscripten/emsdk emcc helloworld.cpp -o helloworld.js 



{code}
 

In long run, we should aim similar execution for Qt docker images so that customer could run it in same fashion. If this is possible already now, it should be documented as well.

