description:
Our microservice is running in staging version here: 

When any POST request is made, it also throws the API params to the command line. This should not be done as it reveals personal and sensitive information. 
{code:java}
INFO: 10.9.14.70:40414 - "POST /bundle?email=aseem.shakuntal%40qt.io&password=XxXxXxXxxx HTTP/1.1" 500 Internal Server Error ERROR: Exception in ASGI application
{code}

