description:
The effects should be a property of the layer.

{code}
layer.effect: Blur {}
{code}

It should be enough to turn all effects into the actual effect (direct "subclass") and 
add those hints to the .metainfo:

{code}
Hints {
    canBeDroppedInFormEditor: false
    canBeDroppedInNavigator: true
    isMovable: false
    isResizable: false
    canBeReparented: false
    visibleInNavigator: true
    forceNonDefaultProperty: "layer.effect"
}
{code}

The specifics have to be added. Since the effects aer items, but not used as items we have to create a pane for each item.

summary_description_acceptance:
Refactor effects $end$ The effects should be a property of the layer.

