description:
Meta-data has to be communicated to multi-language database

After the excess check was executed and the meta-data was dumped the result has to be stored in the multi-language database.

*Elided strings also have to be marked in a multi-language database.*

{code}
{
"TEXTIDBAR":[{"Size":100, "exceeds":1},{"Size":20, "foo":"blah"}],
"TESTIDFOO":[{"Size":100, "exceeds":0},{"Size":20, "foo":"blah"}]
}
{code}

