description:
there is a need to come up with a new routine that can add  as the same id as property's name during merging work on QDS. 

 
{code:java}
//before    
background: Rectangle {
        width: control.width
        height: control.height
        color: "transparent"
        border.color: "#e6e6e6"
        border.width: 1
    }
{code}
 
