description:
This code fails on 64-bit platforms:

{code}
const QString s = <more than 2^31 characters>
const XmlStringRef ref(&s);
assert(ref == s);
{code}

because s.length() is funneled through an int in XmlStringRef's ctor.

summary_description_acceptance:
Data truncation in XmlStringRef $end$ This code fails on 64-bit platforms:

