description:
We do semantically group classes in the Qt overview documentation: [https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/groups.html] .

Anyhow, _finding_ these overviews is often not straightforward. What we can consider is automatically adding links to the respective class pages, so that e.g. QFile would contain a sentence like

{quote}
   QFile is part of the [Input/Output and Networking|https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/io.html] classes in Qt.
{quote}

