description:
Resulted from implementing QTBUG-104237.

If a C++ or QML type is using \ingroup <group_name> command but there is no \group page for <group_name>, we get a broken link on the type reference page.

Case in point: https://doc-snapshots.qt.io/qt6-dev/qml-qtquick-item.html:

{quote}
Item is part of *qtquick-visual*.
{quote}

