Add ability to directly place QQuickItems in 3D scene without going through Texture component $end$ It should be possible to render 2D Quick content in 3D scenes using the geometry and material's provided by Qt Quick, though this may be difficult in Qt 5.  We should start to investigate the feasibility of doing this now though, and add a convenience path if necessary.  So for example given this scene:


