description:
QDoc prints out the title's warning for documentation comments that do not use the \reimp command. For example, qtscript:

{code}
src/script/api/qscriptextensionplugin.cpp:61: (qdoc) warning: Illegal \reimp; no documented virtual function for QScriptExtensionPlugin::initialize(const QString &key, QScriptEngine *engine)
