description:
This was one of the 4 Qt Multimedia subsystems where there is feature implementation work remaining, this is the most complex one out of the four.

{color:#242424}    - {color}_capturing and playback_
 {color:#242424}        - Basic capture/Recording needs: {color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformMediaCapture{color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformFormatsInfo (could be a stub for only one format){color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformCamera{color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformMediaEncoder{color}
 {color:#242424}        - Taking pictures needs QPlatformCameraImageCapture in addition{color}
 {color:#242424}        - Advanced camera features need {color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformCameraExposure{color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformCameraFOcus{color}
 {color:#242424}            -QPlatformCameraImageProcessing{color}
 {color:#242424}        - qmediacapturesession, qmediaformat,.. linked to qplatform.. backend classes{color}
 {color:#242424}            -audio, codecs, image{color}
 {color:#242424}        - viewing as videoframes{color}
 {color:#242424}            -fullscreen (exists for android?){color}
 {color:#242424}            -native window (android implementation missing){color}
 {color:#242424}        -qvideosink and qvideoframe for both capturing and playback {color}

