See [https://github.com/cplusplus/papers/issues/197] and wg21.link/p1413

Suggested replacements:

{code}
struct { alignas(T) unsigned char data[sizeof(T)]; } x;
// or
union { char dummy; T t; } x;
{code}

summary_description_acceptance:
std::aligned_{storage,union} are deprecated in C++23 $end$ See [https://github.com/cplusplus/papers/issues/197] and wg21.link/p1413

Suggested replacements:

