// or
union { char dummy; T t; } x;
{code} $acceptance criteria:$

description:
QC is failing to detect the correct compiler for Qt 6 for Android. QC 4.14-beta built from this sha [15c9de9251|https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt-creator/qt-creator.git/log/?id=15c9de9251af76fdfd6798ad35d7d912deb99644] works fine, QC 4.14-beta built with more recent changes doesn't work, so seems like something is broken after that sha.
{code:java}
No compiler can produce code for this Qt version. Please define one or more compilers for:
 * unknown-linux-android-elf-unknown{code}
The compilers are detected fine for older Qt versions, QMake properties are also detected fine.

