description:
Here are current compression levels, level 5 is currently in use without possibility to change it
{code:java}
    enum struct Compression {
        Non = 0,
        Fastest = 1,
        Fast = 3,
        Normal = 5,
        Maximum = 7,
        Ultra = 9
