description:
For the Qt installer, I can only find out by trying which questions the installer will ask during CLI installation. So far I have run into:

{code}
--auto-answer telemetry-question=No,AssociateCommonFiletypes=No,OverwriteTargetDirectory=Yes
{code}

It would be great if the questions one needs to answer are either documented, or can be dumped by the installer.

