description:
The Qt online installer always installs Qt account settings, so that when you run again, you do not need to type/provide it.

However, this is not ideal in some situations, such as a CI environment (even though the password is not stored in plain text).

The option could look like
{code:java}
--no-save-account{code}
or shortened as
{code:java}
--na{code}

