description:
With the addition of protobuf support, we can now expect {{\*.proto}} files to show up in source trees, if only as test data; these are source files that should probably be subject to at least some of our usual checks for source files (except for test data in {{tests/.\*/data/}} directories, as ever).

From these we generate {{\*.cpp}} files that start with the header line
{noformat}
/* This file is autogenerated. DO NOT CHANGE. All changes will be lost */
{noformat}
which is not currently matched by the inanity 'bot check for generated files; we should add that to its vocabulary.

